#: ../../../adoption.rst:2
msgid "Who uses psutil"
msgstr "誰在使用 psutil"

#: ../../../adoption.rst:8
msgid ""
"psutil is among the `top 100 <https://clickpy.clickhouse.com/dashboard/"
"psutil>`__ most-downloaded packages on PyPI, with **390+ million** downloads "
"per month and **780,000+** `GitHub repositories <https://github.com/"
"giampaolo/psutil/network/dependents>`__ using it. The projects below are a "
"sample of notable software that uses it. They are grouped by how much of the "
"project depends on psutil, and every usage links to the code that calls "
"psutil. See also :doc:`alternatives` for related Python libraries and "
"equivalents in other languages."
msgstr ""

